WEBVTT

00:00:03.245 --> 00:00:03.799
WHERE ARE WE?

00:00:03.843 --> 00:00:05.540
A GRAVEYARD.

00:00:05.584 --> 00:00:09.501
THIS IS NO GRAVEYARD.
[SIGHS]

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.552
IT'S A CHESSBOARD.

00:00:30.043 --> 00:00:31.523
THERE'S THE DOOR.

00:00:43.796 --> 00:00:46.494
NOW WHAT DO WE DO?

00:00:46.538 --> 00:00:47.800
IT'S OBVIOUS, ISN'T IT?

00:00:47.843 --> 00:00:50.977
WE GOT TO PLAY OUR WAY
ACROSS THE ROOM.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.109
ALL RIGHT, HARRY,

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:55.285
YOU TAKE THE EMPTY
BISHOP'S SQUARE.

00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:57.592
HERMIONE, YOU'LL BE

00:00:57.636 --> 00:00:59.812
THE QUEEN'S
SIDE CASTLE.

00:00:59.855 --> 00:01:01.465
AS FOR ME,

00:01:01.509 --> 00:01:04.120
I'LL BE A KNIGHT.

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:13.042
WHAT HAPPENS NOW?

00:01:13.086 --> 00:01:16.785
WELL, WHITE MOVES FIRST.

00:01:16.829 --> 00:01:20.310
AND THEN...

00:01:20.354 --> 00:01:21.921
WE PLAY.

00:01:32.279 --> 00:01:33.759
RON,

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:37.501
YOU DON'T SUPPOSE THIS
IS GOING TO BE LIKE...

00:01:37.545 --> 00:01:41.418
REAL WIZARD'S CHESS,
DO YOU?

00:01:41.462 --> 00:01:43.943
YOU THERE, D-5.

00:01:59.132 --> 00:02:00.916
YES, HERMIONE.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:06.139
I THINK THIS IS GONNA BE
EXACTLY LIKE WIZARD CHESS.

00:02:11.623 --> 00:02:13.799
CASTLE TO E-4!

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:20.457
PAWN TO C-3!

00:03:05.024 --> 00:03:06.112
WAIT A MINUTE.

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:09.158
YOU UNDERSTAND
RIGHT, HARRY.

00:03:09.202 --> 00:03:11.683
ONCE I MAKE MY MOVE,

00:03:11.726 --> 00:03:14.294
THE QUEEN
WILL TAKE ME.

00:03:14.337 --> 00:03:17.253
THEN YOU'RE FREE
TO CHECK THE KING.

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.951
NO. RON, NO!

00:03:18.994 --> 00:03:20.082
WHAT IS IT?

00:03:20.126 --> 00:03:22.041
HE'S GOING TO
SACRIFICE HIMSELF.

00:03:22.084 --> 00:03:23.129
NO, YOU CAN'T!

00:03:23.172 --> 00:03:25.218
THERE MUST BE
ANOTHER WAY!

00:03:25.261 --> 00:03:26.436
DO YOU WANT
TO STOP SNAPE

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.961
FROM GETTING
THAT STONE OR NOT?

00:03:29.004 --> 00:03:31.485
HARRY, IT'S YOU
THAT HAS TO GO ON.

00:03:31.528 --> 00:03:32.965
I KNOW IT.

00:03:33.008 --> 00:03:35.097
NOT ME, NOT HERMIONE.

00:03:35.141 --> 00:03:36.272
YOU.

00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:48.720
KNIGHT TO H-3.

00:04:10.045 --> 00:04:12.613
CHECK.

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:37.072
AAH!

00:04:41.381 --> 00:04:43.426
RON!

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.385
NO! DON'T MOVE!

00:04:45.428 --> 00:04:48.431
DON'T FORGET,
WE'RE STILL PLAYING.

00:05:04.143 --> 00:05:05.753
CHECKMATE.

00:05:25.294 --> 00:05:26.948
TAKE CARE OF RON.

00:05:26.992 --> 00:05:28.341
THEN
GO TO THE OWLERY.

00:05:28.384 --> 00:05:30.473
SEND A MESSAGE
TO DUMBLEDORE.

00:05:30.517 --> 00:05:32.171
RON'S RIGHT.

00:05:32.214 --> 00:05:34.260
I HAVE TO GO ON.

00:05:34.303 --> 00:05:36.828
YOU'LL BE OK, HARRY.

00:05:36.871 --> 00:05:38.351
YOU'RE A GREAT WIZARD.

00:05:38.394 --> 00:05:40.614
YOU REALLY ARE.

00:05:40.657 --> 00:05:42.964
NOT AS GOOD AS YOU.

00:05:43.008 --> 00:05:44.966
HEH. ME?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.968
BOOKS AND CLEVERNESS.

00:05:47.012 --> 00:05:49.057
THERE ARE MORE
IMPORTANT THINGS.

00:05:50.276 --> 00:05:51.217
FRIENDSHIP AND BRAVERY.
